          "`test_tool_runtime_is_only_tool_execution_path`",
          "All tool execution goes through `ToolRuntime.execute_one()` — no bypass",
          "Low — already true"
        ],
        [
          "5",
          "`test_runtime_supervisor_is_only_subprocess_authority`",
          "All subprocess creation goes through `RuntimeSupervisor` — no raw `subprocess.run()`",
          "Medium — bash tool and validate runner both use it"
        ],
        [
          "6",
          "`test_ralph_never_constructs_toolruntime_or_agent`",
          "Ralph modules import no tool execution or agent infrastructure",
